# Magsaysay!

Magsaysay, who has become the ruler of the Philippine Islands, has pledged to eradicate the Communist Party there and is conducting a reign of terror. This anti-Communist, who continually issues the orders "Seize them! Shoot them!", naturally enjoys America's abundant blessing and affection. Magsaysay's domination, suppressing the people's rising voice in the Philippines, is today at its height.

But...

For how long?
